WEBVTT

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:15.504
Morning, everyone.

00:00:15.504 --> 00:00:17.158
Good morning, everyone.

00:00:17.158 --> 00:00:18.594
CHILDREN:
Good morning,
Professor Sprout.

00:00:18.594 --> 00:00:20.553
Welcome to Greenhouse Three,
second years.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.555
Now, gather around, everyone.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:25.166
Today, we're going
to re-pot Mandrakes.

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:27.038
Who here can tell me

00:00:27.038 --> 00:00:29.780
the properties
of the Mandrake root?

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.825
Yes, Miss Granger?

00:00:31.825 --> 00:00:33.827
Mandrake, or Mandragora,

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:36.700
is used to return
those who have been Petrified

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:38.702
to their original state.

00:00:38.702 --> 00:00:41.617
It's also
quite dangerous.

00:00:41.617 --> 00:00:44.751
The Mandrake's cry is fatal
to anyone who hears it.

00:00:44.751 --> 00:00:47.580
Excellent.
10 points to Gryffindor.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.583
Now, as our Mandrakes
are still only seedlings,

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.280
their cries won't kill you yet,

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.282
but they could knock you out
for several hours,

00:00:54.282 --> 00:00:55.806
which is why I've given
each of you

00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:57.808
a pair of earmuffs
for auditory protection.

00:00:57.808 --> 00:01:01.159
So could you please
put them on right away?

00:01:01.159 --> 00:01:02.813
Quickly.

00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:04.249
Flaps tight down,

00:01:04.249 --> 00:01:05.859
and watch me closely.

00:01:05.859 --> 00:01:08.993
You grasp
your Mandrake firmly...

00:01:08.993 --> 00:01:11.517
you pull it sharply up
out of the pot...

00:01:11.517 --> 00:01:12.910
[HIGH-PITCHED SQUEALING]

00:01:15.956 --> 00:01:17.044
Got it?

00:01:17.044 --> 00:01:18.350
And...

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:21.832
now you dunk it down
into the other pot...

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:25.444
and pour a little sprinkling
of soil to keep him warm.

00:01:28.186 --> 00:01:32.407
Longbottom's
been neglecting his earmuffs.

00:01:32.407 --> 00:01:35.062
No, ma'am, he's just fainted.

00:01:35.062 --> 00:01:36.847
Yes, well, just leave him there.

00:01:36.847 --> 00:01:39.066
Right, on we go.

00:01:39.066 --> 00:01:41.155
Plenty of pots to go around.

00:01:41.155 --> 00:01:42.461
Grasp your Mandrake...

00:01:42.461 --> 00:01:45.072
and pull it up!

00:01:58.694 --> 00:02:00.696
There's
Nearly Headless Nick.

00:02:00.696 --> 00:02:03.612
Hello, Percy.
Miss Clearwater.

00:02:03.612 --> 00:02:05.310
Hello, Sir Nicholas.

00:02:17.278 --> 00:02:20.673
Say it. I'm doomed.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.501
You're doomed.

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:23.502
Hi, Harry!

00:02:25.591 --> 00:02:28.072
I'm Colin Creevey.
I'm in Gryffindor too.

00:02:28.072 --> 00:02:30.204
Hi, Colin.
Nice to meet you.

00:02:30.204 --> 00:02:31.205
[OWL SHRIEKS]

00:02:31.205 --> 00:02:32.424
Ron, is that your owl?

00:02:46.568 --> 00:02:48.701
Bloody bird's a menace.

00:02:54.011 --> 00:02:55.273
Oh, no.

00:02:55.273 --> 00:02:56.840
Look, everyone.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:59.233
Weasley's got himself a Howler.

00:03:00.626 --> 00:03:02.019
Go on, Ron.

00:03:02.019 --> 00:03:04.630
I ignored one from my gran once.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:05.936
It was horrible.

00:03:13.117 --> 00:03:14.988
MRS. WEASLEY'S VOICE:
Ronald Weasley!

00:03:17.817 --> 00:03:20.646
How dare you steal that car!

00:03:20.646 --> 00:03:23.823
I am absolutely disgusted!

00:03:23.823 --> 00:03:26.695
Your father's now
facing an inquiry at work,

00:03:26.695 --> 00:03:29.263
and it's entirely your fault!

00:03:29.263 --> 00:03:33.572
If you put
another toe out of line,

00:03:33.572 --> 00:03:35.617
we'll bring you straight home!

00:03:37.315 --> 00:03:39.186
Oh, and, Ginny, dear,

00:03:39.186 --> 00:03:41.275
congratulations
on making Gryffindor.

00:03:41.275 --> 00:03:45.105
Your father and I
are so proud.

00:03:46.802 --> 00:03:48.674
Pttthhh!

